# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OMARI workshop .gitignore
# Rules are anchored with a leading "/" where they refer to one top-level
# folder. An unanchored `data/` used to hide website/src/data/ (source code),
# which broke builds from a fresh clone. Do not re-add an unanchored `data/`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Node / website build output
node_modules/
website/dist/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dataset and training outputs at the repository root (CLI default locations)
/data/
/artifacts/
/runs/
/checkpoints/

# Model weights, wherever they are
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

# Large archives (the 2.1 GB FETAL_PLANES_ZENODO.zip, Drive downloads)
*.zip

# Website artifact bundle. It is generated by scripts/finalize_website_bundle.py,
# is ~70 MB and contains CC BY 4.0 dataset images, so it is deployed, not committed.
website/public/experiments/*
!website/public/experiments/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# content/ = local copy of the Colab filesystem (see README, "Colab outputs").
# Everything is ignored (dataset 4 GB, runs 8.5 GB, checkpoints 0.9 GB,
# website_bundle/website_export with dataset images, embeddings .npz) EXCEPT
# small text provenance files that pin the reported results:
#   - dataset_stats.json, faithfulness.csv
#   - splits/split_manifest.csv (exact split used; 1.9 MB; contains absolute
#     /content/... paths, re-root with --data-root) and splits/near_duplicates.csv
#   - runs/*/summary.json and runs/*/history.json (metrics, hyper-parameters,
#     checkpoint sha256; ~150 KB each in total)
# Prediction .npz files stay ignored (binary, pickled object arrays).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/content/*
!/content/omari_artifacts/
/content/omari_artifacts/*
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/
/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/*
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/dataset_stats.json
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/faithfulness.csv
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/splits/
/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/splits/*
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/splits/split_manifest.csv
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/splits/near_duplicates.csv
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/runs/
/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/runs/*/*
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/runs/*/summary.json
!/content/omari_artifacts/omari_artifacts/runs/*/history.json

# Stale single-file build of the website (pre-training, 2026-11-10; produced by a
# step that is not in the repository). Rebuild with `cd website && npm run build`.
/OMARI-Workshop-Open-Directly.html

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo
